function restoreFeedback(form,data){$$('[data-dynamic]',form).forEach(i=>{const v=data?.[i.dataset.dynamic];if(v===undefined||v===null)return;if(i.multiple){for(const o of i.options)o.selected=Array.isArray(v)&&v.includes(o.value);}else i.value=String(v);if(i.type==='range'){i.disabled=false;const label=i.closest('label');$('output',label).textContent=String(v);$('.answer-range',label).hidden=true;}});}
